msgid "(The ASCII letters `ia` pass through `translate` unchanged.)"
msgstr ""

#. heading 3
#: site/lectures/07-text-and-regex.md:1753
msgid "Greedy and lazy quantifiers"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-text-and-regex.md:1755
msgid "`*` also matches **nothing** - zero digits are \"0 or more\". With `findall`, that gives empty strings between the matches:"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-text-and-regex.md:1765
msgid "When you want \"at least one\", write `+`, not `*`."
